# Security

Generated security posture is model-owned and should be reviewed before production deployment.

## IAM and Secrets

- IAM wildcard usage without justification is reported as a blocking manual action in production mode.
- Plaintext secret `ValueExpression` instances are blocked by the generation validator.
- Secret and SSM dynamic references are emitted as CloudFormation dynamic references when modeled.

